<title>USA: IMM currency futures expand gains, hit new peaks.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures expand gains, hit new peaks.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 8 - IMM currency futures expanded gains, hit new session peaks. June yen rose again in busy trade, lifted by continued influx of buying that hit periodic buystops as resistance levels gave way, including the April 1 high at $0.008335. The 100-day moving average stood near $0.008357, with the March 11 high holding at $0.008360.</p>
